{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18085","headline":"赠别元十八协律六首 三 · 韩愈","name":"赠别元十八协律六首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾友柳子厚，其人艺且贤。\n吾未识子时，已览赠子篇。\n寤寐想风采，於今已三年。\n不意流窜路，旬日同食眠。\n所闻昔已多，所得今过前。\n如何又须别，使我抱悁悁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}